faithfulnessScore\": 0.88889, \"validCitationIndexes\": [2]}, {\"text\": \"如是报表查询拖慢从库，可在确认是可中断的只读查询后临时执行 kill <id> [证据5]。\", \"claim\": \"如是报表查询拖慢从库，可在确认是可中断的只读查询后临时执行 kill <id> 。\", \"supported\": true, \"exactEvidence\": true, \"citationIndexes\": [5], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.7931, \"validCitationIndexes\": [5]}, {\"text\": \"本次确认为报表全表扫描且未走索引，申请 L2 kill，值班台于 09:52 审批通过后执行 kill 48213 [证据2]。\", \"claim\": \"本次确认为报表全表扫描且未走索引，申请 L2 kill，值班台于 09:52 审批通过后执行 kill 48213 。\", \"supported\": true, \"exactEvidence\": true, \"citationIndexes\": [2], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.77778, \"validCitationIndexes\": [2]}, {\"text\": \"若是主库批量写入导致，联系业务方降速或改为分批提交，每批 1000 行并 sleep 50ms [证据5]。\", \"claim\": \"若是主库批量写入导致，联系业务方降速或改为分批提交，每批 1000 行并 sleep 50ms 。\", \"supported\": true, \"exactEvidence\": true, \"citationIndexes\": [5], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.97059, \"validCitationIndexes\": [5]}, {\"text\": \"10:05 观察延迟回落到 6s [证据2]。\", \"claim\": \"10:05 观察延迟回落到 6s 。\", \"supported\": true, \"exactEvidence\": true, \"citationIndexes\": [2], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.9, \"validCitationIndexes\": [2]}, {\"text\": \"10:31 再次确认为 Seconds_Behind_Master: 0，Slave_SQL_Running_State 为 Replica has read all relay log;\", \"claim\": \"10:31 再次确认为 Seconds_Behind_Master: 0，Slave_SQL_Running_State 为 Replica has read all relay log;\", \"supported\": false, \"exactEvidence\": false, \"citationIndexes\": [], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.0, \"validCitationIndexes\": []}, {\"text\": \"waiting for more updates [证据2]。\", \"claim\": \"waiting for more updates 。\", \"supported\": true, \"exactEvidence\": true, \"citationIndexes\": [2], \"faithfulnessScore\": 1.0, \"validCitationIndexes\": [2]}, {\"text\": \"操作前主从延迟为 42s，操作后为 0s；\", \"claim\": \"操作前主从延迟为 42s，操作后为 0s；\", \"supported\": false, \"exactEvidence\": false, \"citationIndexes\": [], \"faithfulnessScore\": 0.0, \"validCitationIndexes\": []}, {\"text\": \"报表查询操作前阻塞 31 分钟，操作后已终止并改写；\", \"claim\": \"报表查询操作前阻塞 31 分钟，操作后已终止并改写；\", \"supported\": false, \"exactEvidence\