看看」\\nStep 6 变更闭环：单内填写实际结果、耗时与遗留项，24 小时内闭环\", \"summary\": \"Step 1 变更单：ITSM 提交，写明变更内容、影响面、回滚方案、验证方法\\nStep 2 预发验证：预发环境全量回归，性能不低于现网 95%\\nStep 3 灰度发布：5% → 30% → 100%，每档观察 15 分钟\\nStep 4 指标观察：错误率、P99、CPU、慢查询、业务核心指标\\nStep 5 全量或回滚：指标异常立即回滚，不得「观察看看」\\nStep 6 变更闭环：单内填写实际结果、耗时与遗留项，24 小时内闭环\", \"confidence\": 0.68, \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-08 20:11:59\", \"entity_codes\": [\"二、发布流程（六步）\", \"发布流程\", \"Step\", \"ITSM\", \"P99\", \"CPU\", \"回滚\"], \"evidence_ids\": [\"EVD_c1fb4f86a7a943d2953b3968d39ef4ce\"], \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_d5097469a4fb46c5a03b47cb7031ef1b\", \"evidence_hash\": \"cc3ccc981c2a4cc9ac8ac904cc59691b382c90f20c85e1d25e83e83850c5f60d\", \"evidence_count\": 11, \"knowledge_code\": \"K_f50815e541f7479a9bec940fa63268b9\", \"authority_score\": 0.9, \"permission_tags\": \"[\\\"ops\\\",\\\"sre\\\",\\\"dba\\\"]\"}], \"claims\": [], \"eventId\": \"6b7e3d4f-89e4-4c18-9c7c-7b6ef7b6aefa\", \"entities\": null, \"relations\": null, \"indexVersion\": 1, \"knowledgeBaseId\": 2}','SUCCEEDED',1,8,'2026-10-08 20:11:59',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"graph\": {\"provider\": \"neo4j\", \"available\": true, \"edgesCreated\": 0, \"nodesCreated\": 1}, \"total\": 602, \"indexed\": 1, \"external\": {\"milvus\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"milvus\"}, \"elasticsearch\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}}, \"graphView\": 201}','2026-10-08 20:11:59','2026-10-08 20:13:25','2026-10-08 20:13:25'),(228,'1739f780-5604-4780-b301-cdd7cdfe2cee','CARD_CREATE:K_4e4ca1e8b0af4eff9abb382750ce2127:1',2,'CARD','KB:2:CARD:K_4e4ca1e8b0af4eff9abb382750ce2127','KNOWLEDGE_OBJECT_UPSERT',1,'/ai/index/knowledge','{\"cards\": [{\"type\": \"RULE\", \"title\": \"三、灰度与观察指标\", \"status\": \"DRAFT\", \"content\": \"三、灰度与观察指标\\n\\n灰度期间必须同时观察以下指标，任一超标即停止放量：\", \"summary\": \"三、灰度与观察指标\\n\\n灰度期间必须同时观察以下指标，任一超标即停止放量：\", \"confidence\": 0.68, \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-08 20:11:59\", \"entity_codes\": [\"三、灰度与观察指标\", \"灰度期间\"], \"evidence_ids\": [\"EVD_360bf51aa1f442c5bdd34475f283fc7a\"], \"evidence_code\": 