AFT\", \"content\": \"描述：并发执行 8 个渠道结算任务时，MySQL 报 Deadlock found when trying to get lock，任务失败率 12%。\\n\\n复现步骤：\\n\\n压测环境配置 8 个渠道，结算批次日期相同；\\n\\n同时触发 8 个结算任务；\\n\\n观察 settle-service 日志与 MySQL 死锁日志。\\n\\n期望结果：8 个任务全部成功，无死锁。 实际结果：平均 1 个任务失败，报错 Deadlock found when trying to get lock; try restarting transaction。\\n\\n根因（初判）：update tsettlebatch set status=? where channel=? and settledate=? 与 insert into tsettle_detail 的顺序在不同渠道间不一致，形成循环等待。\\n\\n处置方案：\\n\\n统一更新顺序（按 channel 编码排序加锁）；\\n\\n结算明细批量插入改为分批（每批 1,000 行）；\\n\\n增加死锁重试（最多 3 次，间隔 100ms）。\\n\\n关联：PAY-2481（结算任务改造）、PAY-2487（索引优化）\\n\\nPAY-2491 · 结算金额精度丢失\", \"summary\": \"描述：并发执行 8 个渠道结算任务时，MySQL 报 Deadlock found when trying to get lock，任务失败率 12%。\\n\\n复现步骤：\\n\\n压测环境配置 8 个渠道，结算批次日期相同；\\n\\n同时触发 8 个结算任务；\\n\\n观察 settle-service 日志与 MySQL 死锁日志。\\n\\n期望结果：8 个任务全部成功，无死锁。 实际结果：平均 1 个任务失败，报错 Deadlock found when trying to get lock; tr\", \"confidence\": 0.68, \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-08 20:25:11\", \"entity_codes\": [\"AND\", \"In\", \"PAY-2481\", \"PAY-2487\", \"SQL\", \"PAY-2491\", \"PAY-2499\"], \"evidence_ids\": [\"EVD_629c918354514cd79596ed1472a0a5b5\"], \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_ed06bbc11f19464d9ecd70b9b3eb722c\", \"evidence_hash\": \"ada441364b5f0a79acef342faf418477472fccf7549a9e3828dbb119a96b682f\", \"evidence_count\": 13, \"knowledge_code\": \"K_4e159b7e4b2c472898be9464c9a7eac1\", \"authority_score\": 0.9, \"permission_tags\": \"[\\\"rd\\\",\\\"pm\\\",\\\"qa\\\",\\\"sre\\\"]\"}], \"claims\": [], \"eventId\": \"81a83f7d-06f2-47f6-b757-b2d0ee65ffcf\", \"entities\": null, \"relations\": null, \"indexVersion\": 1, \"knowledgeBaseId\": 4}','SUCCEEDED',1,8,'2026-10-08 20:25:11',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"graph\": {\"provider\": \"neo4j\", \"available\": true, \"edgesCreated\": 0, \"nodesCreated\": 1}, \"total\": 215, \"indexed\": 1, \"external\": {\"milvus\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"milvus\"}, \"elasticsearch\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}}, \"graphView\": 39}','2026-10-08 20:25:11','2026-10-08 20:27:19',