\", \"title\": \"4.4 清结算（T+0 改造）\", \"status\": \"DRAFT\", \"content\": \"4.4 清结算（T+0 改造）\\n\\n现状：T+1 批处理，每日 02:00 结算前一日交易；\\n\\n目标：T+0，按渠道维度并行结算，支持日内多批次（PAY-2481/2485）；\\n\\n结算数据模型：批次（tsettlebatch）→ 明细（tsettledetail，decimal(20,4)）→ 汇总（tsettlesummary）；\\n\\n差错处理：对账差异进入差错池，支持人工补单（PAY-2482）与自动补偿（KOS-3407）。\\n\\n五、数据模型（核心表）\", \"summary\": \"4.4 清结算（T+0 改造）\\n\\n现状：T+1 批处理，每日 02:00 结算前一日交易；\\n\\n目标：T+0，按渠道维度并行结算，支持日内多批次（PAY-2481/2485）；\\n\\n结算数据模型：批次（tsettlebatch）→ 明细（tsettledetail，decimal(20,4)）→ 汇总（tsettlesummary）；\\n\\n差错处理：对账差异进入差错池，支持人工补单（PAY-2482）与自动补偿（KOS-3407）。\\n\\n五、数据模型（核心表）\", \"confidence\": 0.68, \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-08 20:26:19\", \"entity_codes\": [\"PAY\", \"TTL\"], \"evidence_ids\": [\"EVD_6170f7fead354bfc94ceb5a27974afe9\"], \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_2130f160aff74843886f6be268279897\", \"evidence_hash\": \"d08f9c9abfaa8552b20e7ce98e4acc3a0c9951305b11fde118487475eb425ae9\", \"evidence_count\": 16, \"knowledge_code\": \"K_43598f76f80943268db5e9a9eb712dc1\", \"authority_score\": 0.9, \"permission_tags\": \"[\\\"rd\\\",\\\"pm\\\",\\\"qa\\\",\\\"sre\\\"]\"}], \"claims\": [], \"eventId\": \"70a0fbf5-9a88-4a80-bd74-a2b1714b447d\", \"entities\": null, \"relations\": null, \"indexVersion\": 1, \"knowledgeBaseId\": 4}','SUCCEEDED',1,8,'2026-10-08 20:26:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"graph\": {\"provider\": \"neo4j\", \"available\": true, \"edgesCreated\": 0, \"nodesCreated\": 1}, \"total\": 351, \"indexed\": 1, \"external\": {\"milvus\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"milvus\"}, \"elasticsearch\": {\"indexed\": 1, \"provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}}, \"graphView\": 115}','2026-10-08 20:26:19','2026-10-08 20:29:10','2026-10-08 20:29:10'),(1241,'9cd47cd9-38b9-4abe-8b66-d389a4162383','STATUS:KB:4:CLAIM:CLM_1c7cee060a3c455f831ed27dc53e3938:CONFLICTED:CONFLICT:CLM_1c7cee060a3c455f831ed27dc53e3938:CLM_4b0f0fd24aae4261a1c3f2ac7574d6ba:A',4,'CLAIM','KB:4:CLAIM:CLM_1c7cee060a3c455f831ed27dc53e3938','OBJECT_STATUS_CHANGED',2,'/ai/index/object/status','{\"status\": \"CONFLIC