econdsBehindMaster 达到 42s，读写分离的报表查询读到旧数据，业务反馈「刚下的订单在列表里看不到」。\\n\\n二、操作过程\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": null, \"source_uri\": \"upload://12-运维命令操作记录-CL-2026-08-0157-MySQL主从延迟处置.md\", \"document_id\": 12, \"object_type\": \"CONTENT_UNIT\", \"source_name\": \"12-运维命令操作记录-CL-2026-08-0157-MySQL主从延迟处置.md\", \"content_hash\": \"6b6a24fcf3f9236f767a1247a07cb34ef318afd7d4448fc6effab4b4b94814d7\", \"heading_path\": \"运维命令操作记录 · CL-2026-08-0157 · MySQL 主从延迟处置\", \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_8221761fac8544b09ac7dd5bbb1274c2\", \"evidence_hash\": \"6b6a24fcf3f9236f767a1247a07cb34ef318afd7d4448fc6effab4b4b94814d7\", \"generation_id\": null, \"source_version\": 1, \"content_unit_id\": 129, \"permission_tags\": null, \"matched_channels\": [\"bm25\"], \"retrieval_provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}, \"rrfScore\": 0.01885245901639344, \"rankDelta\": 0, \"chunkBoost\": 1.59, \"fusionRank\": 1, \"rerankRank\": 1, \"rerankScore\": 0.95, \"channelRanks\": {\"bm25\": 1}, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 1.0, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelScores\": {\"bm25\": 35.88345}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.03821864754098361, \"scoreBreakdown\": {\"rrfK\": 60, \"channels\": [{\"rank\": 1, \"label\": \"BM25 全文\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"rawScore\": 35.88345, \"rrfContribution\": 0.018852}], \"rrfScore\": 0.01885245901639344, \"rankDelta\": 0, \"chunkBoost\": 1.59, \"filteredBy\": [], \"finalScore\": 0.95, \"fusionRank\": 1, \"rerankRank\": 1, \"whyMatched\": [\"BM25 全文命中第 1 名（原始分 35.8835，通道权重 1.15）\", \"原文段落加成 ×1.59（标题命中 是，问题词覆盖 100%）\"], \"rerankScore\": 0.95, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 1.0, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelWeights\": {\"bm25\": 1.15, \"card\": 1.1, \"claim\": 1.1, \"graph\": 1.05, \"vector\": 1.15}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.03821864754098361, \"qualitySignals\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\"