": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}}}, {\"id\": \"33\", \"score\": 0.4566666666666667, \"title\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"content\": \"# 1) 确认占用目录\\ndu -h --max-depth=2 /data | sort -hr | head\\n# 2) 归档并清理 7 天前日志（禁止直接用 rm -rf，属 L1）\\nfind /data/applogs -name \'*.log.*\' -mtime +7 -exec gzip {} \\\\;\\nfind /data/applogs -name \'*.log.*.gz\' -mtime +30 -delete\\n# 3) 若空间未释放，重启持有已删除句柄的进程（走变更窗口）\\nlsof +L1 | grep deleted\\n# 4) 验证\\ndf -h /data\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": null, \"source_uri\": \"upload://04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"document_id\": 4, \"object_type\": \"CONTENT_UNIT\", \"source_name\": \"04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"content_hash\": \"aec46b28d054093ba3e2d826350f56ce574089196831ccf8f890b69b1801b3f1\", \"heading_path\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_50ee2f3240fb477db6c664d2ed506fa5\", \"evidence_hash\": \"aec46b28d054093ba3e2d826350f56ce574089196831ccf8f890b69b1801b3f1\", \"generation_id\": null, \"source_version\": 1, \"content_unit_id\": 33, \"permission_tags\": null, \"matched_channels\": [\"bm25\", \"vector\"], \"retrieval_provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}, \"rrfScore\": 0.034336007130124774, \"rankDelta\": -4, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4175, \"fusionRank\": 1, \"rerankRank\": 5, \"rerankScore\": 0.4566666666666667, \"channelRanks\": {\"bm25\": 8, \"vector\": 6}, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.0417, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelScores\": {\"bm25\": 15.224213, \"vector\": 0.5046704411506653}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.06205589488636362, \"scoreBreakdown\": {\"rrfK\": 60, \"channels\": [{\"rank\": 8, \"label\": \"BM25 全文\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"rawScore\": 15.224213, \"rrfContribution\": 0.016912}, {\"rank\": 6, \"label\": \"向量\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"