 磁盘空间写满导致应用写失败\", \"channel\": \"vector\", \"content\": \"关键说明：文件被删除但句柄仍被持有时，df 不会释放空间，必须先向进程发送 -USR1 触发日志重开句柄，或在应急处置中重启对应进程。禁止直接使用 rm -rf /data/app/logs 整目录清理，该命令在高危命令清单中属于 L2 审批级。\\n\\n恢复验证：确认写接口成功率回到 99.9% 以上，并在日志平台补全丢失时间段的日志采集。\\n\\ninode 耗尽导致无法创建文件\\n\\n故障现象：df -h 显示磁盘剩余 40%，但创建文件报 No space left on device。\\n\\n故障原因：小文件数量过多导致 inode 用尽，常见来源是应用临时目录堆积的会话小文件。\\n\\n解决步骤：\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": null, \"source_uri\": \"upload://04-运维操作故障处置手册.md\", \"document_id\": 83, \"object_type\": \"CONTENT_UNIT\", \"source_name\": \"04-运维操作故障处置手册.md\", \"content_hash\": \"085babb5ccb7efa691a2403a539a7c3dd90c4154707957cf6a7925a94c62be82\", \"heading_path\": \"运维操作故障处置手册 / 磁盘空间写满导致应用写失败\", \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_a0caea2bc2bd435ab1c950e70c597818\", \"evidence_hash\": \"085babb5ccb7efa691a2403a539a7c3dd90c4154707957cf6a7925a94c62be82\", \"generation_id\": null, \"source_version\": 1, \"content_unit_id\": 459, \"permission_tags\": [], \"matched_channels\": [\"vector\"], \"retrieval_provider\": \"local\"}, \"rrfScore\": 0.018548387096774192, \"rankDelta\": 7, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4325, \"fusionRank\": 10, \"rerankRank\": 3, \"rerankScore\": 0.5666666666666667, \"channelRanks\": {\"vector\": 2}, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.125, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelScores\": {\"vector\": 0.5370583534240723}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.033877469758064514, \"scoreBreakdown\": {\"rrfK\": 60, \"channels\": [{\"rank\": 2, \"label\": \"向量\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"vector\", \"rawScore\": 0.5370583534240723, \"rrfContribution\": 0.018548}], \"rrfScore\": 0.018548387096774192, \"rankDelta\": 7, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4325, \"filteredBy\": [], \"finalScore\": 0.5666666666666667, \"fusionRank\": 10, \"rerankRank\": 3, \"whyMatched\": [\"向量命中第 2 名（原始分 0.5371，通道权重 1.15）\", \"原文段落加成 ×1.43（标题命中 是，问题词覆盖 12%）\"], \"rerankScore\": 0.5666666666666667, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.125, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelWeights\": {\"bm25\": 1.15, \"card\": 1.1, \"claim\": 1.1, \"graph\": 1.05, \"vector\": 1.15}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.033877469758064514, \"qualitySignals\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}}}, {\"id\": \"34\", \"score\": 0.49333333333333335, \"title\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"content\": \"恢复验证：df -h 显示使用率 < 80%，应用日志恢复正常写入，接口错误率回落。\\n\\n3.2 负载飙高但 CPU 占用不高\\n\\n现象：load 达到 40+，top 中 CPU 使用率并不高，业务响应变慢。\\n\\n原因：大量进程处于 D 状态（不可中断睡眠），通常是磁盘 IO 打满或 NFS 挂载异常。\\n\\n处置步骤：\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": null, \"source_uri\": \"upload://04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"document_id\": 4, \"object_type\": \"CONTENT_UNIT\", \"source_name\": \"04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"content_hash\": \"64a813f4fed4fbdad059f2698abc98cef662960cc7c9d31ea2e14995056b88e9\", \"heading_path\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_07f3de1d60a040828b8911e9b27ac5cc\", \"evidence_hash\": \"64a813f4fed4fbdad059f2698abc98cef662960cc7c9d31ea2e14995056b88e9\", \"generation_id\": null, \"source_version\": 1, \"content_unit_id\": 34, \"permission_tags\": null, \"matched_channels\": [\"bm25\", \"vector\"], \"retrieval_provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}, \"rrfScore\": 0.032525712025316456, \"rankDelta\": -1, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4325, \"fusionRank\": 3, \"rerankRank\": 4, \"rerankScore\": 0.49333333333333335, \"channelRanks\": {\"bm25\": 4, \"vector\": 19}, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.125, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelScores\": {\"bm25\": 22.415226, \"vector\": 0.4451690912246704}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.059406180157238926, \"scoreBreakdown\": {\"rrfK\": 60, \"channels\": [{\"rank\": 4, \"label\": \"BM25 全文\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"rawScore\": 22.415226, \"rrfContribution\": 0.017969}, {\"rank\": 19, \"label\": \"向量\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"vector\", \"rawScore\": 0.4451690912246704, \"rrfContribution\": 0.014557}], \"rrfScore\": 0.032525712025316456, \"rankDelta\": -1, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4325, \"filteredBy\": [], \"finalScore\": 0.49333333333333335, \"fusionRank\": 3, \"rerankRank\": 4, \"whyMatched\": [\"BM25 全文命中第 4 名（原始分 22.4152，通道权重 1.15）\", \"向量命中第 19 名（原始分 0.4452，通道权重 1.15）\", \"原文段落加成 ×1.43（标题命中 是，问题词覆盖 12%）\"], \"rerankScore\": 0.49333333333333335, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.125, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelWeights\": {\"bm25\": 1.15, \"card\": 1.1, \"claim\": 1.1, \"graph\": 1.05, \"vector\": 1.15}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.059406180157238926, \"qualitySignals\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}}}, {\"id\": \"33\", \"score\": 0.4566666666666667, \"title\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"content\": \"# 1) 确认占用目录\\ndu -h --max-depth=2 /data | sort -hr | head\\n# 2) 归档并清理 7 天前日志（禁止直接用 rm -rf，属 L1）\\nfind /data/applogs -name \'*.log.*\' -mtime +7 -exec gzip {} \\\\;\\nfind /data/applogs -name \'*.log.*.gz\' -mtime +30 -delete\\n# 3) 若空间未释放，重启持有已删除句柄的进程（走变更窗口）\\nlsof +L1 | grep deleted\\n# 4) 验证\\ndf -h /data\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": null, \"source_uri\": \"upload://04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"document_id\": 4, \"object_type\": \"CONTENT_UNIT\", \"source_name\": \"04-Linux主机巡检与故障排查操作手册.md\", \"content_hash\": \"aec46b28d054093ba3e2d826350f56ce574089196831ccf8f890b69b1801b3f1\", \"heading_path\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置 / 3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\", \"evidence_code\": \"EVD_50ee2f3240fb477db6c664d2ed506fa5\", \"evidence_hash\": \"aec46b28d054093ba3e2d826350f56ce574089196831ccf8f890b69b1801b3f1\", \"generation_id\": null, \"source_version\": 1, \"content_unit_id\": 33, \"permission_tags\": null, \"matched_channels\": [\"bm25\", \"vector\"], \"retrieval_provider\": \"elasticsearch\"}, \"rrfScore\": 0.034336007130124774, \"rankDelta\": -4, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4175, \"fusionRank\": 1, \"rerankRank\": 5, \"rerankScore\": 0.4566666666666667, \"channelRanks\": {\"bm25\": 8, \"vector\": 6}, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.0417, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelScores\": {\"bm25\": 15.224213, \"vector\": 0.5046704411506653}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.06205589488636362, \"scoreBreakdown\": {\"rrfK\": 60, \"channels\": [{\"rank\": 8, \"label\": \"BM25 全文\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"rawScore\": 15.224213, \"rrfContribution\": 0.016912}, {\"rank\": 6, \"label\": \"向量\", \"weight\": 1.15, \"channel\": \"vector\", \"rawScore\": 0.5046704411506653, \"rrfContribution\": 0.017424}], \"rrfScore\": 0.034336007130124774, \"rankDelta\": -4, \"chunkBoost\": 1.4175, \"filteredBy\": [], \"finalScore\": 0.4566666666666667, \"fusionRank\": 1, \"rerankRank\": 5, \"whyMatched\": [\"BM25 全文命中第 8 名（原始分 15.2242，通道权重 1.15）\", \"向量命中第 6 名（原始分 0.5047，通道权重 1.15）\", \"原文段落加成 ×1.42（标题命中 是，问题词覆盖 4%）\"], \"rerankScore\": 0.4566666666666667, \"chunkSignals\": {\"coverage\": 0.0417, \"headingHit\": 1.0}, \"qualityBoost\": 1.275, \"channelWeights\": {\"bm25\": 1.15, \"card\": 1.1, \"claim\": 1.1, \"graph\": 1.05, \"vector\": 1.15}, \"preRerankScore\": 0.06205589488636362, \"qualitySignals\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}}}, {\"id\": \"32\", \"score\": 0.4566666666666667, \"title\": \"Linux 主机巡检与故障排查操作手册 / 三、典型故障与处置\", \"channel\": \"bm25\", \"content\": \"三、典型故障与处置\\n\\n3.1 磁盘写满导致服务不可用\\n\\n现象：应用报 No space left on device，日志出现写入失败，支付下单接口 5xx 上升。\\n\\n原因：应用日志未轮转，单日增长 12GB；或日志文件被删除但进程仍持有句柄，空间未释放。\\n\\n处置步骤：\", \"quality\": {\"evidence\": 0.0, \"authority\": 0.5, \"freshness\": 0.6, \"confidence\": 0.5}, \"metadata\": {\"status\": null, \"page_no\": nu